      "writtenOn": "2022-10-18T17:20:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agree, though at this point, I think I\u0027d rather avoid the yoda-ism in the name, and make it something like `hasAtLeastNBytes()` (then invert all the checks).",
